[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4743.51, "timestamp": "01:19:03", "text": "等等，难道我不是在做难以置信的借口吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4745.149, "timestamp": "01:19:05", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4748.709, "timestamp": "01:19:08", "text": "等等，它说呃，抱歉，继续广播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4757.11, "timestamp": "01:19:17", "text": "我不是活着吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4759.07, "timestamp": "01:19:19", "text": "居住"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4761.79, "timestamp": "01:19:21", "text": "哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4768.189, "timestamp": "01:19:28", "text": "然后我就这么做了，我直接开播了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4781.83, "timestamp": "01:19:41", "text": "但打完这场比赛后，我就会明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4796.03, "timestamp": "01:19:56", "text": "那边有一片土地，而且条件"}]